.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt WAIT4PATH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm wait4path
.Nd wait for a path to exist
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
returns when
.Ar path
exists, waiting until then: for a volume being mounted, say.
It looks again each time a file system is mounted, and at least once a
second.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 once the path exists; 1 on a usage error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mount 8
.Sh HISTORY
Minkar's
.Nm
is its own.
